# ── Dua corpus + hub pages ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These were untracked 2026-07-31 during the upstream licensing hold (ADR-063).
# The owner lifted that hold the same day (ADR-064) and all 32 paths are tracked
# again, so nothing here is ignored. Kept as a note because the ignore block
# would have silently skipped any newly generated hub once the files were
# re-tracked — a trap worth naming rather than deleting quietly.
